  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>GR_EnergyHMG</defName>
    <label>Gray Energy MachineGun</label>
    <description>Gray standard energy heavy machine gun, also known as Lumenward. Known for its size and weight, it is as heavy as an iron block and too large for a human to operate by hand; apart from the Gray, it is only used as a mounted weapon. It carries a particle accelerator, energy stabilizer, and rapid cooling system, paired with multiple large high-voltage energy cells at the rear, allowing it to fire high-energy projectiles continuously at a despairing rate—turning everything in sight into a wilderness of flesh. However, due to its size, weight, and excessive power, the Gray only occasionally use it when defending outposts; its poor portability always excludes it from field operations.</description>
